From 39ede623e3b00aab832c116640d16a3e528b28fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pedro CVLAB <vaz.valois@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 21:47:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Batch 1: name the duplicated literals and the magic
 constants

Fixes ALL-DUPL0005, ALL-STRI0002, PY-CONS0001, ALL-COMM0001, ALL-COMM0002
and PY-TYPE0003. The repeated refusal strings become one named constant per
module, the decorative banners go, the essay comments shrink to one line, the
commented-out entry point is deleted, and the project targets Python 3.14.
---
 mcp_server.py  | 64 +++++++++++++++++---------------------------------
 mcp_tools.py   | 52 ++++++++++++++--------------------------
 pyproject.toml |  3 ++-
 3 files changed, 40 insertions(+), 79 deletions(-)

